WEBVTT

1
00:00:17,740 --> 00:00:19,980
In one more day, all these things will be soaked.

2
00:00:19,980 --> 00:00:30,520
Leave as much as you can

3
00:00:30,520 --> 00:00:36,230
These will come in handy later

4
00:00:36,230 --> 00:00:37,310
The boss has quite a lot of inventory.

5
00:00:37,310 --> 00:00:40,750
It's a pity that in a few hours everything will have to be soaked in water.

6
00:00:40,750 --> 00:00:48,000
Every little bit is a little bit, don’t waste it

7
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:49,680
In the ink room, smoking and drinking are all forced to pass

8
00:00:49,680 --> 00:00:51,680
You can exchange it for something even if you don’t use it yourself.
